      "x-credential-instructions": "Use the API base URL and adviser contact ID issued by LMG. Paste an existing access_token obtained with your issued client ID, client secret and approved scopes using MyCRM's client_credentials flow. Leads-only credentials are available in MyCRM Profile Management \u2192 API Access Management; other operations require additional access from LMG. Tokens expire: replace the token here when it expires. NoClick does not exchange or refresh tokens. The API base URL must be the issued HTTPS origin before /jsonapi. Listing contacts proves contact-search access; leads-only credentials may save as unverified or be rejected if they lack that access.",
